Subject: [PATCH] Adapt original net/fence live view addresses and compiler syntax
Upstream-base: 2c5c51e483b652d178ef06a44b83b07a0f97d2a6

Preserve original weak symbols, live view choices, quad submission and
secondary-NIS save/restore. Use the existing pointer-width view carrier
for native live addresses and the genuine double fabs compiler intrinsic.
Original console declarations, expressions and bodies remain unchanged.

diff --git a/include/Game/Drawable/DrawableNetMesh.h b/include/Game/Drawable/DrawableNetMesh.h
